  "slug": "blackwork-geometric-persian-inspired",
  "title": "Geometric Persian-inspired all-over",
  "subtitle": "Interlocking star and hexagon shapes on an even grid",
  "excerpt": "The geometric Persian-inspired all-over draws on the counted geometric tradition shared between Iberian and Moorish embroidery that reached England. Interlocking six-pointed stars and hexagons tile without gaps. Dense; requires accurate counting at every row.",
