            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Wash in cool water, press face-down on a thick towel, and frame or mount. Finished size depends on how many repeats you work; the chart tile gives the unit size."
